@startuml RecallAI-Architecture-3Tier
!pragma layout smetana
' SAD Section 4 — Architectural Representation (3-tier). Issue #84 / I5.1.
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam component {
  BackgroundColor #FDFDFF
  BorderColor #6A6AC0
}
title Recall AI — 3-Tier Architecture Overview

package "Presentation Tier" #F5F5FF {
  [React SPA\n(Vite + TypeScript)] as SPA
  note right of SPA
    Tailwind CSS + shadcn/ui (Radix)
    react-hook-form + Zod
    React Router · Axios client
  end note
}

package "Application Tier" #F5FFF5 {
  [Express.js REST API\n(Controllers -> Services)] as API
  [Scheduling & Remediation\nEngine (SRE)] as SRE
  note bottom of SRE
    Deterministic software logic only — no AI calls.
    Today: DAG validation (DagUtil, Kahn's algorithm).
    Planned (Sprint 4-5): priority scheduling +
    reverse-BFS concept traceback over review_queue_items.
  end note
}

package "Data Tier" #FFF8F0 {
  database "PostgreSQL" as DB
  [Prisma ORM] as ORM
}

package "External AI Service" #FFF0F0 {
  [Google Gemini API] as Gemini
  note bottom of Gemini
    4 fixed-schema calls only:
    extract_concepts, generate_question,
    grade_answer, summarize_session.
    No free-form responses (constraint C4/C5).
  end note
}

SPA --> API : HTTPS REST\n(JSON, JWT Bearer)
API --> ORM : Prisma Client
ORM --> DB : SQL (TCP)
API ..> SRE : invokes\n(deterministic routing, C4)
API --> Gemini : HTTPS REST\n(fixed JSON schema)

legend right
  |= Tier |= Responsibility |
  | Presentation | UI rendering, client-side validation, routing |
  | Application  | Business logic, auth, orchestration, SRE |
  | Data         | Persistent storage (PostgreSQL via Prisma) |
  | External     | Gemini API — called only for narrow, schema-\nconstrained extraction/generation/grading tasks |
endlegend

@enduml
